  {
    "id": "alba-brunet",
    "name": "Alba Brunet",
    "character": "Serafina “Fina” Valero",
    "birthPlace": "Palma de Mallorca",
    "birthDate": "1993-10-18",
    "photo": "actors/alba-brunet.webp",
    "bio": {
      "es": [
        "Alba Brunet es una actriz mallorquina que, con tan solo 16 años, dejó su isla para trasladarse a Barcelona y formarse en interpretación en el Institut del Teatre. Desde entonces ha seguido completando su formación con diferentes cursos y profesionales.",
        "Ha participado en numerosos proyectos de cine y televisión, destacando especialmente por sus interpretaciones de Leonor Hidalgo en Acacias 38 y Fina Valero en Sueños de libertad. Aunque el teatro ha sido el ámbito en el que menos ha trabajado, ha expresado su deseo de seguir profundizando en él.",
        "También ha sido docente y coach de interpretación, acompañando a niños, jóvenes y otros actores en su formación.",
        "En el plano personal comparte su vida con el actor Pep Ambròs y juntos son padres de Rai."
      ],
      "en": [
        "Alba Brunet is a Mallorcan actress who, at just 16, left her island to move to Barcelona and train in acting at the Institut del Teatre. She has kept building on that training ever since through various courses and mentors.",
        "She has taken part in numerous film and television projects, standing out in particular for her performances as Leonor Hidalgo in Acacias 38 and Fina Valero in Sueños de libertad. Although theatre is the field she has worked in least, she has said she hopes to keep delving deeper into it.",
        "She has also worked as an acting teacher and coach, guiding children, young people and fellow actors through their training.",
        "In her personal life she shares her days with the actor Pep Ambròs, and together they are parents to Rai."
      ]
    },
